<title>USA: Staples, Office Depot won't merge.</title>
<headline>Staples, Office Depot won't merge.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staples Inc and Office Depot Inc said Wednesday in a joint release that the proposed merger between the two companies has been terminated.</p>
<p>Staples operates 666 office products superstores worldwide. Office Depot operates 576 stores.</p>
</text>
